# Replace placeholders with the deployed HTTPS URL, organization ID, and delegated API token.
@baseUrl = https://license.example.invalid
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ruleId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@deliveryId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@token = replace-with-delegated-api-token

### List central notification rules (ViewInventory + ViewFindings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/notification-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or replace a rule (ManagePolicies); severity 3 = High
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/notification-rules/{{ruleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleId": "{{ruleId}}",
  "name": "Important access and risk changes",
  "enabled": true,
  "minimumSeverity": 3,
  "findings": true,
  "effectiveAccess": true,
  "added": true,
  "removed": true,
  "changed": true,
  "channel": "security"
}

### Recent comparable-scan changes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/drift-events?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recent delivery/retry states
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/notification-deliveries?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Individual delivery and attempts (404 for an unknown delivery)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/notification-deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid page size (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/drift-events?limit=501
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
